        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roosevelt%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Roosevelt sits in northern Minnesota, just a short drive from the expansive Lake of the Woods that borders Canada.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
