        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Roosevelt%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Canadian National Railway extended through Roosevelt in 1904, spurring early growth and linking the community to wider markets.",
